A set of readily usable volumetric models of intracranial vessels to study aneurysm flow dynamics, practicing the endovascular treatment, or developed new methods for aneurysm diagnostic. 

 Specifically: 

  model 1  - a model of a basilar tip aneurysm (58 years, female); 

  model 2  - a model of carotid terminus aneurysm (57 years, female); 

  model 3  - a model of a middle cerebral artery bifurcation aneurysm (65 years, male). 

 The images illustrating the model lumina are also provided.

