This linked open dataset contains data of Lombardy, Italy, i.e.: 


	 Analytical data of river water bodies, including flow rate; 
	 Analytical data of lake water bodies; 
	 Analytical data of groundwater; 
	 Height of the lakes; 
	 Infectious diseases rates; 
	 Meteo observations and weather stations.
